            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho narora malaika ayemeriire omu izooba, yayeta n'iraka likooto enyonyi zoona eziharruka haiguru omu burangasa ati: “Mwije mwesorooze ha kiihuro ekikuru kya Ruhanga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwije mulye enyama ey'abakama, ey'engabwa ez'amahe, n'ey'emanzi: enyama ey'embaraasi n'abatembi baazo, n'ey'abantu boona, ab'obugabe n'abairu, abato n'abakuru!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
